<title>USA: Intrenet approve Arthur Andersen as auditor.</title>
<headline>Intrenet approve Arthur Andersen as auditor.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Ohio 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intrenet Inc's shareholders voted to approve Arthur Andersen LLP as its independent auditor at its annual shareholder meeting on May 16.</p>
<p>Intrenet is the parent to four wholly owned full truckload carriers and a logistics division: Roadrunner Trucking Inc, Eck Miller Transportation Corp, Advanced Distribution System, Inc, Roadrunner Distribution Services Inc and INET Logistics.</p>
</text>
